        {
          "id": 2214974530,
          "type": null,
          "body": "We also might need to try to install `minizip-ng-compat-devel` before `minizip-devel`, unless the former gets installed by providing the later.\n\nApparently the latter does happen for now, see my own comment in #19778",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/99c30adacedf45514aaf711ba8a44f56322ebb53e9b550b7e3c9cd83bd6a1408?s=80&d=identicon",
