      "title": "rpm-setup: zlib-ng / zlib updates",
      "message": "rpm-setup: zlib-ng / zlib updates\n\nFedora 40 replaced their zlib packages with zlib-ng:\nhttps://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/MinizipNGTransition\n\nUpdate rpm-setup.sh to try zlib-ng-compat then zlib, and make\nzlib-ng-compat a basic package.\n",
